          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 78173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aprendamos a escribir declaraciones condicionales que manejen condiciones específicas como en el programa a continuación.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    const greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 78176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Al mover el deslizador, este programa utiliza declaraciones condicionales para mostrar diferentes saludos si la hora es menor que 7, 12, 17 y 21.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    const greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando declaraciones <code>if</code> y <code>else</code>, podemos escribir un programa que muestre un saludo si <code>hour</code> es menor que <code>12</code> y otro si no cumple la condición.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>hour</code> seguido de <code>&lt;</code> y finalmente <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Este programa saluda de una forma antes del mediodía y de otra en caso contrario.</p><p>Pon <code>hour</code> a la izquierda. Crea la condición para mostrar <code>Good morning</code> cuando sea menor que <code>12</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>hour</code> seguido de <code>&lt;</code> y finalmente <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para una condición más específica, como si <code>hour</code> es mayor que <code>12</code>, <strong>pero</strong> menor que <code>17</code>, podemos codificar <code>elif hour &lt; 17:</code> en su lugar.</p><p><code>elif</code> significa else if. <code>elif</code> se utiliza cuando hay una segunda condición que debe verificarse cuando la condición del bloque <code>if</code> no se cumple.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>elif</code> seguido de <code>hour &lt; 17</code> y finalmente <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>elif</code> significa <em>else if</em>: una segunda condición que se verifica cuando el <code>if</code> fue falso.</p><p>La verificación de la mañana ya falló. Agrega la rama para que la consola muestre <code>Good afternoon</code> cuando <code>hour</code> sea menor que <code>17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hour &lt; 12\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>elif</code> seguido de <code>hour &lt; 17</code> y finalmente <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La <strong>declaración elif</strong> ejecuta su bloque de código si las condiciones anteriores fueron <code>False</code> y su condición, como <code>hour &lt; 17</code>, es <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>hour &lt; 17</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else statement",
            "id": 78162,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos codificar una declaración <code>else</code> para ejecutar su bloque de código cuando las condiciones <code>if</code> y <code>elif</code> son <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good night\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Siempre que vayan antes de la declaración <code>else</code>, podemos agregar tantos enunciados <code>elif</code> como queramos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>elif</code> seguido de <code>elif</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puedes añadir tantas ramas <code>elif</code> como quieras antes del <code>else</code> final.</p><p>Completa las dos ramas intermedias para que la consola muestre <code>Good evening</code> cuando <code>hour</code> sea <code>20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>elif</code> seguido de <code>elif</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Adding elif",
            "id": 78161,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than ten&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Less than ten\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Less than ten</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Menos de cinco</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Less than ten</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué este código muestra <code>Less than ten</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than ten&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Less than ten\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>number &lt; 5</code> es <code>False</code> y luego <code>number &lt; 10</code> es <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ambas condiciones son <code>True</code>, pero el bloque <code>elif</code> reemplaza la salida de <code>if</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python omite la condición <code>if</code> siempre que haya un <code>elif</code> después.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>number &lt; 5</code> es <code>False</code> y luego <code>number &lt; 10</code> es <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: elif keyword",
            "id": 78160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You got an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You passed\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>You passed</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>¡Tienes una A!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>You passed</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué este código muestra <code>You passed</code> en lugar de <code>¡Tienes una A!</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You got an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You passed\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>score &gt;= 90</code> es <code>False</code>, pero <code>score &gt;= 70</code> es <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ambas condiciones son <code>True</code>, así que Python solo ejecuta el bloque <code>elif</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">El bloque <code>elif</code> se ejecuta antes de que Python compruebe la condición <code>if</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>score &gt;= 90</code> es <code>False</code>, pero <code>score &gt;= 70</code> es <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: else statement",
            "id": 78159,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué sucede cuando las condiciones de las declaraciones <code>if</code> y <code>elif</code> devuelven <code>False</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"66\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You get an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Better luck next time!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Better luck next time!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">El bloque de código de la declaración <code>else</code> se ejecuta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No pasa nada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">El bloque de código de la declaración <code>else</code> se ejecuta.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El bloque <code>else</code> se ejecuta cuando las condiciones <code>if</code> y <code>elif</code> son <code>False</code>.</p><p>La salida de abajo corresponde a <code>score = 66</code>. Si <code>score</code> fuera <code>80</code>, ¿qué bloque se ejecutaría?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"66\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You get an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Better luck next time!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Better luck next time!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">El bloque <code>elif</code> muestra <code>You passed!</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">El bloque <code>if</code> muestra <code>You get an A!</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">El bloque <code>else</code> muestra <code>Better luck next time!</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">El bloque <code>elif</code> muestra <code>You passed!</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
