            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra un mensaje en la consola cuando <code>age</code> es mayor que <code>12</code> y menor o igual a <code>16</code> codificando una declaración <code>elif</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Where are your parents?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You're too young to ride this ride.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You're too young to ride this ride.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>elif</code> seguido de <code>age &lt;= 16</code> y finalmente <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega la rama intermedia para que la consola muestre <code>You're too young to ride this ride.</code> cuando <code>age</code> sea mayor que <code>12</code> y hasta <code>16</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Where are your parents?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You're too young to ride this ride.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age &lt; 16\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You're too young to ride this ride.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>elif</code> seguido de <code>age &lt;= 16</code> y finalmente <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
