            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica las palabras clave para una declaración <code>elif</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"topping = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pepperoni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" topping == \" /><text value=\"&quot;pineapple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request denied.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" topping == \" /><text value=\"&quot;pepperoni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request accepted.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Request accepted.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>elif</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La primera verificación de topping falla. Agrega la palabra clave de la segunda verificación para que la consola muestre <code>Request accepted.</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"topping = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pepperoni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" topping == \" /><text value=\"&quot;pineapple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request denied.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" topping == \" /><text value=\"&quot;pepperoni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request accepted.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Request accepted.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>elif</code>.</p></body></html>"
