            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra un mensaje en la consola cuando <code>topping</code> no sea igual a <code>\"pineapple\"</code> o <code>\"pepperoni\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"topping = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mushrooms&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" topping == \" /><text value=\"&quot;pineapple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request denied.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" topping == \" /><text value=\"&quot;pepperoni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request accepted.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Could not process request.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"142\" endIndex=\"177\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Could not process request.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>else</code> seguido de <code>:</code> y finalmente <code>print(\"Could not process request.\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El ingrediente no es <code>\"pineapple\"</code> ni <code>\"pepperoni\"</code>. Añade la rama final para mostrar <code>Could not process request.</code></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"topping = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mushrooms&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" topping == \" /><text value=\"&quot;pineapple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request denied.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" topping == \" /><text value=\"&quot;pepperoni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request accepted.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Could not process request.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"142\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(&quot;Request accepted.&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Could not process request.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>else</code> seguido de <code>:</code> y finalmente <code>print(\"Could not process request.\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
